    "text": "By John Kampf jkampf@news-herald.com ,\n7 hours ago Leigha Blazetic, Wickliffe, Sr.: She went 11-9 with 211 strikeouts in 117 innings and also hit .409 with five home runs and 28 RBI. The more a pitcher strikes’em out, the less chance for something bad to happen in the field, and she’s the area’s K-Queen. She’s an Edinboro commit. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
